  "phase_3": {
    "user_prompt": "Calculate the groundwater-level elevation for each measurement by subtracting the depth to water from the land-surface elevation for each site. Filter the data to only include 'static' measurements (exclude records affected by recent or nearby pumping) taken in the month of February (winter) of each year from 2012 to 2019 to minimize seasonal irrigation effects. For the well with site number 392853105015001, calculate the relative difference in groundwater-level elevation between its February 2012 and February 2019 measurements (2019 value minus 2012 value).",
