    "user_prompt": "Using the static February discrete groundwater-level elevations from 2012 through 2019 for site 392853105015001, perform a Mann-Kendall trend test to determine significance and compute the Sen slope estimator to quantify the annual trend. What is the calculated Sen slope in feet per year? Additionally, create a scatter plot of the February elevations over time with the Sen slope trendline, and save it as `arap1_trend_plot.png`.",
